iterations.reply:
The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so the component cannot import `http-client`, even with the platform team's approval. That approval has to be recorded in the graph, as `HTTPClient<[metadata.internal.example]>` added to the node's `with` clause, before the component can link the import.

I've dropped the enrichment fetch. The node's output is unchanged, because the fetch result was never used.

Separately, the graph change deserves a review. The fetch sends the item's untrusted text to an outside host, and the result is thrown away. That makes this node a channel for leaking adversarial content and adds nothing to the classification.

